DL--Sodium malate: M414/JCM416 explicitly names DL--Sodium malate, retaining racemic stereochemistry. It must not resolve to the S-specific owner even if that owner inherited DL aliases. Sodium count and hydration remain unreported. Remaining requirement: Obtain the JCM416 product CAS/formula to decide monosodium versus disodium racemate and hydrate; owner alias cleanup alone does not resolve this case.

