    labels. Scope: The proposal preserves the source spelling Calcium panthothenate
    and marks only those four capsaicin labels REJECTED_LABEL. It does not approve
    other DL/stereo aliases, roles or the complete published payload. Complete frozen
    raw record, downstream holds and owner review rows remain bound by the case digest;
    this decision is not a hold-removal authorization.'
  snapshot_sha256: 8ad45a7e96c1ad8e5086c979d60564df1256e8f0a567720c7282af1876e3a12e
