    not prove all suppliers, catalog formulations or the full OADC mixture are identical
    to generic bovine serum albumin. Existing generic-owner ruling preserves supplier/form
    detail separately. Remaining requirement: Identify the fraction-V product in each
    original source before adding supplied_form; retain OADC nesting and do not add
    a universal resolving fraction-V synonym.'
