  details: 'mediadive.ingredient:1590: DSMZ 1740 explicitly expands Titriplex 1 as
    nitrilotriacetic acid. Merck Titriplex I 108416 SDS identifies CAS 139-13-9, agreeing
    with the source acid formula and mass and CHEBI:44557. Potassium hydroxide is
    added separately during preparation and is not the supplied substance. Remaining
    requirement: Coordinate duplicate-owner reconciliation and existing acid-owner
    payload defects; the alias proposal alone does not retire Titriplex1.yaml or release
    unrelated aliases.'
